   conflict with Part I remain applicable.

   7(d). Redistribution of the Complete License

   If You redistribute Kumi or any Derivative Work of Kumi, You must
   provide recipients with a complete copy of this entire License,
   including both Part I and Part II. Providing Part II alone does not
